dc11:source a owl:ObjectProperty.
<http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2445.txt> a owl:Thing.
xsd:integer a rdfs:Datatype.
xsd:string a rdfs:Datatype.
<http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/ical> dc11:source <http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc2445.txt>;
                                     a owl:Thing;
                                     rdfs:seeAlso <http://www.w3.org/2002/12/cal/>,
                                                  <http://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/www-rdf-calendar/>,
